          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary><span>How do YouTubers and Twitch streamers set up wheel challenges cleanly?</span></summary>
            <p>Open any gaming or sports wheel, click "Embed Wheel" in the Save &amp; Share card to copy an ad-free <code>?embed=1</code> URL for OBS Browser Source, or use Fullscreen Mode with sound effects on.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary><span>Are all 32 NFL, 30 NBA, 30 MLB, and 20 Premier League teams included?</span></summary>
            <p>Yes—every pro sports wheel loads the complete active roster plus conference, league, and tier presets so you never need to type teams by hand.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary><span>How do we prevent two squadmates from drawing the same Dandy's World Toon or NFL team?</span></summary>
            <p>Switch ON "Remove Winner After Spin" in Settings before spinning so each drawn team or character exits the wheel automatically.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary><span>Can I update Fortnite POIs or add custom roster mods?</span></summary>
            <p>Yes! Use Add Entry, remove vaulted spots with ✕, or click Bulk Paste Entries to drop updated seasonal locations or custom challenge rules (up to 500 items).</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary><span>How do we decide who gets first spin in a friend draft?</span></summary>
            <p>Load your friend group onto <a href="/fantasy-draft-order-wheel">Fantasy Draft Order Wheel</a> or <a href="/presentation-order-wheel">Presentation Order Wheel</a> with elimination ON to assign draft picks #1 through #N fairly.</p>
          </details>
        </div>

